# AI Gateway

Product chat is **AG-UI** on `apps/ai`, not Vercel AI SDK (`useChat`, `streamText` in UI/modules).

- Model ids: Gateway form (`openai/...`, `anthropic/...`); use `resolveChatModelId` / tenant `ai.config`.
- Env: `AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY`; browser base `VITE_ENGENTY_AI_BASE_URL` (host only).
- Do not add `createOpenAI` / `createAnthropic` constructors in new code.
- See [howto-ai-config.md](../../../packages/ai-core/docs/howto-ai-config.md).
